05_1755479235441074_5994484144304008040_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kabawsTsiqsQ7kNvwFZE1Cg&_nc_oc=AdoVaCucOkXW0w_g5Jd4BdvpA29-9N-3yuehIDLJxkKwcF4fb_jhQRDt-CYUAd8ThiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Qdl4gpnbYqlu9IPKSRAIwNO2S7YnYGaP3VWoZMeLXiA&oe=6A0C78EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coverImage.png", "id": "4397079430608272", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_4397079437274938_5368497134026920143_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oAalHPkrRaAQ7kNvwEKlI2h&_nc_oc=AdoeGBFNh7O51MmBK5SxdRpBKrV2k-gFhTSmL-tIfgowtoVoDOOD86zt3W2nax0jN6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Vpg4xT4S9-WQlowwDQHk3b12C6Q6ZY29rH-AwhArrPA&oe=6A0C89F3"}, "display_name": "School Orientation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"School Orientation\" is a VR application designed to support middle school students during the transition to high school.\n\nThrough an experiential journey, the app helps reveal personal talents and natural inclinations through various activities:\n\nPractical Lab Activities: Test your technical and manual skills with hands-on challenges and simulations.\n\nAptitude Tests: Discover your strengths with activities designed to identify the fields where you excel.\n\nExploring Knowledge: An interactive journey through different subject areas to understand which sectors spark your interest most.\n\nInformed Choices: An engaging tool for students to reflect on their future and reduce uncertainty when moving to high school.\n\nThe future begins with self-knowledge: discover your talents before choosing your next educational path.", "short_description": "Helping middle school students discover their potential through practical activities, aptitude tests, and interactive challenges for an informed high school choice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/docume